OL,3,GNEWSAParents proud to have 'spoken up'
OL,4,Aover care concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May, Camphill Milton Keynes
OL,7,FCommunities, a charity supporting
OL,8,Fadults with learning disabilities,
OL,9,Fagreed to take over the
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire-based service.
OL,12,FLou said there had been "such highs and
OL,13,Flows" as she and other families fought
OL,14,Ffor the continuation of the service.
